## 0.0.1 (October 15, 2024)

Beta Release:

- Provide a beta release for publishers to use the Content Delivery JS SDK.
- Only supports Staging environment, and not a production-ready release.
- Ads Providers supported: `RPP-BTA`, `Google AdEx`, `Yahoo`, `RPP-SWAD`.
- Provide some default templates to be used for each Ads Providers.

## 1.0.1 (November 05, 2024)

Release:

- Add optional callbacks support for themeSDK's renderTheme method.

## 1.1.0 (March 19, 2025)

Release:

- Public Release of Content Delivery JS SDK to deliver `Coupon Advance` Ads.

## 1.2.0 (September 17, 2025)

Release:

- Add `RUNA` ads provider support (RUNASDK module).
- Add AdEx SDK module enhancements.
- Add ResizeObserver module for responsive ad slot handling.
- Update README documentation.

## 1.3.0 (November 27, 2025)

Release:

- Enhancements to MainSDK, RUNASDK, and AdExSDK modules.
- Improve ResizeObserver behaviour.
- Increase JS SDK test coverage from 60% to 95% (#1444).

## 1.3.2 (January 16, 2026)

Release:

- Fix AdEx SDK issues (#1508, #1510).

## 1.4.0 (July 30, 2026)

Release:

- Add AdConfigFetcher module for ad configuration fetching.
- Add ad slot priority support (AdSlotPriority types).
- Major enhancements to MainSDK, RUNASDK, and AdExSDK modules.
- Expand test coverage for MainSDK and AdConfigFetcher.
